{"sections":{"1654648672fb8446ef":{"type":"image-with-text-overlay","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Bloch_TAB_0020.jpg","image_link":"","image_position":"center center","width":"full","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"color_overlay_bg":"#ffffff","overlay_opacity":0,"color_overlay_text":"#ffffff","color_overlay_text_mobile":"#000000","overlay_text_above":"","overlay_title":"BEHIND THE CURTAIN","overlay_text":"<p>Bloch is proud to continue its partnership with The Australian Ballet in Behind the Curtain – our latest campaign with Bloch Ambassadors and Principal Artists, Amy Harris and Callum Linnane.<\/p>","overlay_url_text_1":"","overlay_url_1":"","overlay_url_text_2":"","overlay_url_2":"","overlay_url_style":"button_1","enlarge_title":true,"enlarge_text":false,"overlay_position_x":50,"overlay_position_y":50,"mobile_text_below":true,"color_label_background":"#ffffff","color_label_text":"#333333","show_chevron":true,"product_id_1":"","chevron_position_1":"right","label_position_x_1":20,"label_position_y_1":30,"product_id_2":"","chevron_position_2":"right","label_position_x_2":80,"label_position_y_2":50}},"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_title":false,"full_width_page":true,"title_alignment":"left"}},"1641343919e110f66c":{"type":"accordion","blocks":{"1641343919f9782d7d-0":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"New South Wales","text":"<p>&lt;p&gt;Your content here&lt;\/p&gt;<\/p>"}},"1641343919f9782d7d-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"Column","text":"<p>Your content here<\/p>"}},"1641343919f9782d7d-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"Column","text":"<p>Your content here<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["1641343919f9782d7d-0","1641343919f9782d7d-1","1641343919f9782d7d-2"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Accordion Header","color_bg":"#ffffff","color_hover":"#eeeeee","color_text":"#000000"}},"16547586819901c638":{"type":"image-with-text-overlay","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/EDM_16.png","image_link":"","image_position":"center center","width":"page","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"color_overlay_bg":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","overlay_opacity":80,"color_overlay_text":"#333333","color_overlay_text_mobile":"#333333","overlay_text_above":"","overlay_title":"","overlay_text":"","overlay_url_text_1":"","overlay_url_1":"","overlay_url_text_2":"","overlay_url_2":"","overlay_url_style":"button_1","enlarge_title":false,"enlarge_text":false,"overlay_position_x":50,"overlay_position_y":70,"mobile_text_below":false,"color_label_background":"#ffffff","color_label_text":"#333333","show_chevron":true,"product_id_1":"","chevron_position_1":"right","label_position_x_1":20,"label_position_y_1":30,"product_id_2":"","chevron_position_2":"right","label_position_x_2":80,"label_position_y_2":50}},"165464882050018cc3":{"type":"rich-text","settings":{"image-top":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/logos.png","title":"","text":"<p>An immeasurable amount of work goes in to what you see at a performance. Training, rehearsals, strengthening and conditioning. We work closely with the dancers of The Australian Ballet to provide reliable shoes that can keep up with their schedule, allowing them to perform at their best when the curtains rise.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","url_style":"button_1","enlarge_title":false,"enlarge_text":true,"full_width":false,"color_bg":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","color_title":"#333333","color_text":"#000000"}},"1654660433bbd259f2":{"type":"image-with-text","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Bloch_TAB_0006.jpg","image_link":"","image_size":"0","image_position":"right","text_above":"<p><strong>CRAFTSMANSHIP<\/strong><\/p>","title":"","text":"<p>Amy wears a dress by <strong>Toni Maticevski<\/strong>, an icon of Australian fashion design who shares Bloch’s value for quality craftsmanship. <\/p><p>Amy’s pointe shoes – along with our entire range – are hand crafted using the finest materials.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","url_style":"button_1","enlarge_title":false,"enlarge_text":true,"text_alignment":"left","color_bg":"#ffffff","color_text":"#202020"}},"1654757364e3c99dcb":{"type":"rich-text","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>\"I think every ballerina remembers the day they had their first pair of pointe shoes fitted. It’s quite a milestone for a dancer! For me, my relationship with Bloch goes back to when I was around age 11. Now, at age 38 and in my 21st year dancing professional I have tried many shoe styles, I’ve also been spoilt with shoe fittings and custom pairs of pointe shoes, but Bloch have always been my shoe of choice.\" <\/p><p><br\/><strong>– AMY HARRIS, PRINCIPAL ARTIST<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","url_style":"button_1","enlarge_title":false,"enlarge_text":true,"full_width":false,"color_bg":"#ffffff","color_title":"#333333","color_text":"#000000"}},"1654660725a26672b9":{"type":"image-with-text-overlay","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Bloch_TAB_0021.jpg","image_link":"","image_position":"center center","width":"full","height":"adapt","height_desktop":500,"height_mobile":500,"color_overlay_bg":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","overlay_opacity":0,"color_overlay_text":"#ffffff","color_overlay_text_mobile":"#000000","overlay_text_above":"<p><strong>LISTENING TO DANCERS SINCE 1932<\/strong><\/p>","overlay_title":"","overlay_text":"<p>Callum’s t-shirt features a print of an advertisement from one of Bloch’s original Sydney stores – in our 90th year, we pay homage to our heritage.<\/p>","overlay_url_text_1":"","overlay_url_1":"","overlay_url_text_2":"","overlay_url_2":"","overlay_url_style":"button_1","enlarge_title":false,"enlarge_text":false,"overlay_position_x":50,"overlay_position_y":90,"mobile_text_below":true,"color_label_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","color_label_text":"#ffffff","show_chevron":true,"product_id_1":"","chevron_position_1":"right","label_position_x_1":50,"label_position_y_1":30,"product_id_2":"","chevron_position_2":"right","label_position_x_2":80,"label_position_y_2":50}},"16546609590e67572a":{"type":"rich-text","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>\"I remember being a student and seeing a photo of David Hallberg in a Bloch campaign and being so inspired. That image of him in a soaring grand jeté stayed with me. I’m thrilled to now be a Bloch Ambassador and the thought that I too could inspire another young dancer to follow their dreams is a wonderful full circle moment.\"<\/p><p><br\/><strong>– CALLUM LINNANE, PRINCIPAL ARTIST<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","url_style":"button_1","enlarge_title":false,"enlarge_text":true,"full_width":false,"color_bg":"#ffffff","color_title":"#333333","color_text":"#000000"}},"1654758098415c1af2":{"type":"slideshow","blocks":{"16547580981c7019db-0":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Bloch_TAB_0026.jpg","image_position":"center center","image_link":"","color_overlay_bg":"#ffffff","overlay_opacity":80,"color_overlay_text":"#333333","color_overlay_text_mobile":"#333333","overlay_title":"","overlay_text":"","overlay_url_text_1":"","overlay_url_1":"","overlay_url_text_2":"","overlay_url_2":"","overlay_url_style":"button_1","enlarge_title":false,"enlarge_text":false,"overlay_alignment":"center","overlay_position_x":50,"overlay_position_y":80,"color_label_background":"#ffffff","color_label_text":"#333333","show_chevron":true,"product_id_1":"","chevron_position_1":"right","label_position_x_1":20,"label_position_y_1":30,"product_id_2":"","chevron_position_2":"right","label_position_x_2":80,"label_position_y_2":50}},"16547580981c7019db-1":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Bloch_TAB_0032.jpg","image_position":"center center","image_link":"","color_overlay_bg":"#ffffff","overlay_opacity":80,"color_overlay_text":"#333333","color_overlay_text_mobile":"#333333","overlay_title":"","overlay_text":"","overlay_url_text_1":"","overlay_url_1":"","overlay_url_text_2":"","overlay_url_2":"","overlay_ur